			"notes": "**This version requires Odin 0.3.6 with MC 26.2, or Odin 0.3.7 with MC 26.3**\n\n# Additions\n- Added a 26.3 release\n- Added a option in the Rabbits feature to show a counter above the rabbit hutches showing how many rabbits are in each\n- Added an option in Spirit Bear to render the particles used in the experimental bear timer\n- Added a bow disintegration warning to titles\n- Added cave waypoints for bers as a part of the Decoy feature\n\n# Changes\n- Changed required Odin version to 0.3.6/0.3.7\n- Changed \"Rabbit Countdown\" feature to \"Rabbits\"\n- Remove old wish title\n- Made bow waypoints render for existing bows\n\n# Fixes\n- Fixed several bugs to do with the experimental bear timer, it should now be usable, and will probably be the default in the next release"
