			"notes": "Note that the logging/replay features are experimental and not working properly\n\nAlso **this will be the last version with support for 1.21.10**, all future versions of BirdAddon will be for 1.21.11+\n\nGitHub actions will also be moving from 1.21.10 to 1.21.11\n\n---\n\nAdded waypoint export/importing\nAdded ability to make waypoints at fractions of a second\nAdded tac timer\nAdded feature to print the time that you tacced at in chat\nAdded decoy feature:\n- decoy spot priority highlight\n- option to hide npcs\n- option to highlight npcs\n- option to hide plants\n\nAdded ability to hide highlighted animals\nAdded rabbits not under thorn to mob counters\nAdded wish title\nAdded extra stats at the end of the run\nAdded option to change the duration of titles \nAdded option to make thorn highlight go red when stunned\nAdded chat hider feature for some of the m4 messages\nAdded bow pickup waypoint that updates dynamically based on bear position\n\nRemoved webserver code completely\n\nFixed a bug with private island detection"
